SYSTEM STATE (as of YYYY-MM-DD):
- Phase: [SETUP EXTRACTION / SETUP BUILD / CHART READER / LIVE]
- Analyst: Tom Vorwald
- Setup library: X/4 defined (Counter-Trade, Trend-Continuation, Breakout, Scalp)
