## PART N - SESSION TRANSITION [v2.0]
# Date: 2026-08-19
# Purpose: Session transition is governed by sys_ai_prompt.md Section 9 + core_engine.md.
#   -> sys_ai_prompt.md Sections 9-10 summarize the same flow.
# No duplicate workflow details are kept here.
